This run verifies the R4 evidence-record revision c115707. Its first attempt
failed for an infrastructure reason only: the two osx-arm64 package-consumer
jobs were never acquired by a hosted runner ("The job was not acquired by
Runner of type hosted even after multiple attempts", a macOS arm64 capacity
constraint), so they were cancelled and the summary job, which requires exactly
six successful consumer cells, failed as a consequence. No job that ran
reported a test, build or packaging failure: the three verify jobs, the pack
job, the candidate verification job and all four linux-x64 and win-x64
consumer cells succeeded in the first attempt. The failed jobs were re-run and
the second attempt is the one recorded above. The R4 content itself was already
verified green by run 45467056283 at bb9e1c9, which ran all 12 jobs
successfully including both osx-arm64 consumer cells.

